e.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/276979112/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/277021540","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2408#issuecomment-277021540","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2408","id":277021540,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3NzAyMTU0MA==","user":{"login":"brabeler","id":15270396,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjcwMzk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15270396?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler","html_url":"https://github.com/brabeler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-02-02T17:18:31Z","updated_at":"2017-02-02T17:18:31Z","body":"I used ffmpeg to add a subtitle track to an existing MP4 file.  So I don't know why the edit list is there, but it seems that ffmpeg always creates an edit list for each track.\r\n\r\nIn my video there is an edit list for every track.  The edit list for the audio and video tracks indicate a duration equal to the length of the video.  But the edit list for the TX3G track indicates a duration equal to the length of that track itself, which is when the last subtitle ends.\r\n\r\nIf the last subtitle ends near the end of the video, then the problem is not very noticeable because the last subtitle is shown for only a few extra seconds.  But the problem really shows itself when the last subtitle is shown for quite a bit longer than it should.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/277021540/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"brabeler","id":15270396,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjcwMzk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15270396?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler","html_url":"https://github.com/brabeler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brabeler/following{/other_us